TEAM TASK MANAGER - FULL STACK PROJECT

----------------------------------------
📌 PROJECT DESCRIPTION
----------------------------------------
Team Task Manager is a full-stack web application where users can create projects, assign tasks, and track progress using role-based access (Admin/Member).

It includes authentication, project management, task tracking, and a dashboard for analytics.

----------------------------------------
🚀 FEATURES
----------------------------------------
✔ User Signup & Login (JWT Authentication)
✔ Role-based Access (Admin / Member)
✔ Create & Manage Projects
✔ Create, Assign & Update Tasks
✔ Task Status Tracking (Pending / Completed)
✔ Dashboard with Statistics:
   - Total Projects
   - Total Tasks
   - Completed Tasks
   - Pending Tasks

----------------------------------------
⚙️ TECHNOLOGIES USED
----------------------------------------
Frontend:
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

Backend:
- Node.js
- Express.js

Database:
- MongoDB Atlas

Authentication:
- JWT (JSON Web Token)
- bcryptjs

----------------------------------------
📡 API ENDPOINTS
----------------------------------------
Auth:
- POST /api/auth/signup
- POST /api/auth/login

Projects:
- POST /api/projects
- GET /api/projects

Tasks:
- POST /api/tasks
- PUT /api/tasks/:id
- GET /api/tasks

Dashboard:
- GET /api/dashboard/stats

----------------------------------------
💻 HOW TO RUN PROJECT LOCALLY
----------------------------------------
1. Clone repository
2. Go to backend folder
3. Run: npm install
4. Create .env file with:
   - MONGO_URI
   - JWT_SECRET
   - PORT
5. Start server:
   npx nodemon server.js
6. Open frontend/login.html

----------------------------------------
🌐 DEPLOYMENT
----------------------------------------
Backend deployed on: Railway
Frontend deployed on: Netlify or Vercel

